@startuml
' Source (synthetic brief): the bookshop's "sales report is late" runbook. The on-call analyst checks
' whether the till CSV arrived. If not, they ask the shop manager to re-export it and wait. If it did,
' they re-run the nightly load in Airflow; the data engineer checks the row counts. If they match, the
' analyst republishes the report; if not, the data engineer opens an incident and the runbook stops.
' house-preamble-begin
' Knob LEGEND_FRAME: colour of the thin frame around the legend ("transparent" removes it).
!$LEGEND_FRAME = "#999999"
!theme plain
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam lifelineStrategy solid
skinparam wrapWidth 300
skinparam maxMessageSize 300
skinparam legendBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam legendBorderColor $LEGEND_FRAME
hide stereotype
hide circle
<style>
root { FontName "Helvetica"; FontSize 12 }
title { FontSize 16 }
rectangle { RoundCorner 14 }
.failure { BackgroundColor #FADBD8 }
.group1 { BackgroundColor #E3F2FD }
.group2 { BackgroundColor #E8F5E9 }
.group3 { BackgroundColor #FFF3E0 }
.group4 { BackgroundColor #F3E5F5 }
</style>
' Numbered steps (optional, STYLE rule 16): $step(1) prints a blue badge in a label, an edge label
' or a legend table row. Knob STEP_BADGE: the badge colour.
!$STEP_BADGE = "#1565C0"
!function $step($n)
!return "<back:" + $STEP_BADGE + "><color:#FFFFFF><b> " + $n + " </b></color></back>"
!endfunction
' house-preamble-end

title Activity diagram for the "sales report is late" runbook (synthetic)

|On-call analyst|
start
:Check the till CSV arrived;
if (CSV in the landing folder?) then (No)
  |Shop manager|
  :Re-export the till CSV;
  |On-call analyst|
  :Wait for the file;
else (Yes)
endif
:Re-run the nightly load;
|Data engineer|
:Compare row counts;
if (Counts match?) then (Yes)
  |On-call analyst|
  :Republish the sales report;
  stop
else (No)
  |Data engineer|
  :Open an incident;
  stop
endif

legend right
  |= Mark |= Meaning |
  | column | one role |
  | rounded box | step |
  | hexagon | decision, branches Yes / No |
  | diamond | branches join again |
  | circle / ringed dot | start / stop |
endlegend
@enduml
